      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the dining room, Vika welcomes Ilya back to the waitstaff and tells him to change into his uniform right away. Meanwhile in the kitchen, Chef Barinov answers a call from Elena Pavlovna and pretends he has already arrived at the airport terminal.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Выходить можешь прямо сегодня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Получай форму, переодевайся.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Спасибо, Виктория Сергеевна.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Супер. Спасибо.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
